  "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>必要依賴模組：</strong></span></p><p><em><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EpicFight 作者：maninthe_home</a></strong></em></p><p><em><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weapons-of-miracles-epicfight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Weapons of Miracles 作者：reascer</a></strong></em></p><p><em><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lendercataclysm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">L_Ender's Cataclysm 作者：mcl_ender</a></strong></em></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-invincible\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><strong>Epic Fight - Invincible 作者：P1nero</strong></em></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>選用模組：（用於自訂頭目）</strong></span></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/combat-evolution\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><strong>Combat Evolution 作者：ShelMarow</strong></em></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>2025年9月14日 - 立即加入我們的Discord：</strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/pnPC3zqfW2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/pnPC3zqfW2</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1216528/description_835af751-2987-4c0a-a13b-6fb398df43b0.png\" width=\"331\" height=\"186\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ydPLajT2vGU?si=t_LmWTSAQb6sxdS-\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>新增自訂頭目：MechX-12</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/6dIAIDafJmI?si=A5u_X9a1uwtu1nl1\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>特殊動作組合包含：煉獄熔爐、虛空熔爐、焚滅者</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zM5ez46-WpA?si=aB0hijPgl7r79qyo\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>特殊動作組合包含：殲滅者、靈魂撕裂者、瓶中沙暴、焚滅者＋烈焰壁壘、焚化者</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/fhJFdI1S73E?si=JCtqt_t9M-cYGLJF\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>特殊動作組合包含：雷霆神兵、潮汐利爪（單手與雙持）</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>歡迎來到《災厄兵器：重製版》</strong></span></p><p><strong>《災厄兵器：重製版》</strong>前身為《災厄兵器：演武藝術》，是為了帶來更多戰鬥！更多技能！更史詩的體驗而擴展的版本<br>- 此為模組版本，方便玩家下載，若偏好資料包形式請前往原版<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/weapons-of-cataclysm-l_enders-cataclysm-weapons-of\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">《災厄兵器》</a>&nbsp;</strong></p><p>- 實際上，《災厄兵器》中的部分自訂動作組合讓我深感興趣，因此我將其視為一份禮物！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em><strong>請各位耐心等待，更多專屬的EFI動作組合即將登場...</strong></em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>社群作品展示：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>迷因嗅探者的狩獵：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/n2j5t6HZjto?si=0mM6n0TfvZxX6hOY\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/XU1f9VIJkK8?si=B0qFiNoZk7I2pVPO\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/S5JNIYR7gTk?si=yPg5HN9Jx5anbQHX\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/OFHyr_lmlCQ?si=N4FoIlt2gIGpYSgj\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>在空中施展此效果時的超神表現&nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>勝利</strong></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-OoN1E2T9ik?si=X9c-saIYRzErWqEF\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div><p><br><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">&nbsp;<strong>「現有內容」清單：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h2><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">*V1.1.0：</span></strong></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">*Invincible動作組合：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">- 焚滅者</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">- 煉獄熔爐</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><strong>-&nbsp;</strong>虛空熔爐</span></p>\n<h2><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">*V1.2.0：</span></strong></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">*Invincible動作組合：</span></p>\n<p>- 殲滅者＋靈魂撕裂者</p>\n<p>- 瓶中沙暴（雙持）<br>- 焚化者（雙持）</p>\n<p>- 焚滅者＋烈焰壁壘</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">*自訂內容：</span></p>\n<p>- <strong>烈焰穿刺者</strong> - <strong>（技能書 - 災厄武藝）</strong> | 以伊格尼斯之矛刺穿敵人並將其釘於刃上持續造成傷害，75%機率由伊格尼斯掉落</p>\n<p><strong>- 幽冥掌握&nbsp;</strong>- <strong>（技能書 - 災厄武藝）</strong> | 以詛咒之握將敵人帶往高空後墜落，引發幽冥之火爆炸，75%機率由詛咒者掉落</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>*V1.3.0：</strong></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">*Invincible動作組合：</span><br>- 雷霆神兵</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">- 潮汐利爪（單手與雙持）</span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>*V1.4.0：</strong></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">*自訂內容：</span></p>\n<p><strong>- 新增頭目：&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">MechX-12&nbsp;</span>及其對應結構</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">授權條款：保留所有權利（＋自訂條款）</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">我保留此模組的所有權利。請遵守以下可執行與禁止事項</span></p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">允許：</span></strong></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">進行展示或評測</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">為此模組製作資源包</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">在遊玩或製作的模組包中使用此模組</span></li>\n</ul><p><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">禁止：</span></strong></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">修改原始程式碼或重新上傳</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">移植此模組至舊版或新版並重新發布（移植行為需<strong>經我授權</strong>）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">將此模組設為您模組的「必要依賴」</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a;text-decoration:underline\"><strong>致謝名單：</strong></span></span></p><p><strong>breadbright</strong> (truncatemol) - 我的朋友，提供創意並繪製了優秀的材質</p><p><strong>TheMemeSmeller</strong> (JustARandomGuy) - <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/weapons-of-cataclysm-l_enders-cataclysm-weapons-of\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">《災厄兵器》（資料包）</a></strong>創作者，與我合作製作相容資料包，並允許我將其內容整合至此模組</p><p><strong>maninthe_home | reascer | mcl_ender | P1nero </strong>- 模組開發者：<strong>EpicFight</strong>&nbsp; | <strong>Weapons Of Miracles</strong> | <strong>L_Ender's Cataclysm | EF-Invincible</strong>&nbsp;感謝製作這些極出色的模組</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
